        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DJO-DLP-210, Steel Outswing Door Security Latch Guard Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis steel security door latch protector is 10\" high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock) with a rosette (levers round plate)  of 3-3/4\" diameter or smaller. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your commercial entry doors from tampering and latch prying with this steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with carriage bolts, washers and acorn cap nuts for safety and strength.  May be used on hollow metal door/frame using ANSI strike.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-DLP-210_size.gif?v=1718159561\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo DLP-210 Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors. Fits doors with standard 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo DLP-210 Security Latch Guard:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 12 Gauge (.104\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel </li>\r\n<li>Offset: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever/Knob Maximum Rosette Diameter: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 2 each carriage bolts, washers and acorn cap nuts</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DLP-210.pdf?v=1718159602\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo DLP-210 Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "10 Inch Security Latch Guard Plate, Don-Jo DLP-210",
                "description": "DJO-DLP-210 latch guard. This steel security door latch protector is 10 inch high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock) with a rosette (levers round plate)  of 3-3/4 inch diameter or smaller.",
